{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1404.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f0b85c18a6ec9ca5e0b6f95a840c1903975d0217444ccacf00e38d03ed3b55d9","ja":"そうなんだ！　上手く節約できたらすっごく\n楽しくてさ、公演が終わった後も続けてるの！","zh":"是这样啊！省钱省得顺利的话会超级\n开心，所以在演出结束后也一直坚持着呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
