{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1404.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3165bd3ee91be7824b04bce245993d3c08f7b9dde315088a877b02ac8ccdcbe3","ja":"あ、それいいかも！\nいっぱい探して、いろいろ試してみようよ、ももちん！","zh":"啊，这个说不定不错！\n多找找看，尝试各种各样的办法吧，桃酱！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
